      <description><![CDATA[<p>Dragging a seedbox file is more robust: Finder and other apps now refuse it instead of receiving a stray data file. The tab bar no longer checks folders on disk while a transfer runs, so a sleeping NAS can't stall the window.</p>]]></description>
